      "statement": "The taxable fixed-income guide binds a 22% municipal target for top-bracket accounts against an 18% neutral weight; its four-point overweight and private-activity concentration are adopted from FI-US-MUNI-CREDIT 2025-06 M.1 and rest on M.2, while below-top-bracket accounts remain at the 18% neutral weight without that concentration.",
