      "statement": "FI-US-MUNI-CREDIT 2025-06 states that its private-activity municipal overweight depends on top-bracket holders largely being outside AMT; a phase-out reduction that draws materially more such holders into AMT means the M.1 recommendation does not survive, while fundamentals alone support only neutral to modest overweight.",
